      "created_at": "2014-04-02T22:33:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually... we are basically out of everything except mini-expansions in our warehouse. We have a few copies left still for conventions and for selling on our web store, but I've been turning down distributors for nearly a month now. Fortunately, most things are in the process of being reprinted, but unfortunately, RC/IR is not likely to be back in stock for distributors until late July / early August.</p>",
